1
00:01:08,539 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:15,870
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:19,080
Xu Jing's improper conduct

4
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:21,990
has not only damaged
my family's reputation,

5
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,150
but also

6
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:26,020
violated basic professional ethics.

7
00:01:27,650 --> 00:01:29,220
Therefore, I call on

8
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,970
the entire industry to unite

9
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:33,840
to blacklist disgraced directors
like Xu Jing,

10
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:36,100
and purify our industry's environment.

11
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,009
Madam.

12
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:38,840
The press conference is about to start.

13
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,200
Okay, let's go.

14
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,250
[Ms. Lin Di'er Accusation
Press Conference]

15
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:49,820
[Defend Marriage Truth,
Purge Industry Misconduct]

16
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:51,680
Why are there so few people?

17
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,820
Have all the media been notified?

18
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:55,620
I confirmed with every single one of them.

19
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:56,620
It should be fine.

20
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:58,740
Strange.

21
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,890
Hello?

22
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,760
Madam.

23
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,000
The reporters we invited

24
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:12,290
all went to another event.

25
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,280
Whose event?

26
00:02:45,579 --> 00:02:50,750
[Mr. Zhao Xiao Incident Clarification
Press Conference]

27
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,000
Everyone.

28
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:57,360
Mr. Zhao Xiao and I

29
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,870
have always maintained a purely
trusting working relationship.

30
00:03:00,870 --> 00:03:01,560
Lies!

31
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:05,080
You make yourself sound so innocent.

32
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,960
How do you explain the photos online?

33
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,520
Also,

34
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,710
what kind of work

35
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:10,280
ends up in an actor's arms?

36
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,460
That night,

37
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,470
Mr. Zhao Xiao and I ran into each other
by chance.

38
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:16,560
The bartender there can testify for me.

39
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,030
As for those photos online

40
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,800
that caused speculation,

41
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,970
it was because I drank too much

42
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,930
and almost fell.

43
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,360
Right at that moment,

44
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,360
Mr. Zhao was passing by and caught me.

45
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,610
I believe in Mr. Zhao's integrity.

46
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,280
He would lend

47
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,310
a helping hand to anyone
without hesitation.

48
00:03:32,310 --> 00:03:33,030
Liar.

49
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:38,650
[Mr. Zhao Xiao Incident Clarification
Press Conference]

50
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:42,020
You've been seducing Zhao Xiao all along.

51
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,940
He told me this himself.

52
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:47,600
[Mr. Zhao Xiao Incident Clarification
Press Conference]

53
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,240
Dear journalists,

54
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,950
don't be fooled by her.

55
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:48,840
She

56
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:52,190
is the homewrecker
who ruined someone else's family.

57
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,310
You call me a homewrecker.

58
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:00,630
Do you have any proof?

59
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,600
Yet you spread rumors

60
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:03,760
and twist the facts.

61
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,280
I have proof of that.

62
00:04:08,230 --> 00:04:10,910
[Huanxun Zonglan Media]

63
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,120
According to my investigation,

64
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,910
the 16 media outlets
that originally reported

65
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:15,250
the false news about Mr. Zhao Xiao and me

66
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:16,380
[The 16 media outlets
that first exposed the false information]

67
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,660
all belong to the same company.

68
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,269
[have now been traced back
to Huanxun Zonglan Media.]

69
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,860
What shocked me even more is that,

70
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,029
after digging into its
shareholding structure,

71
00:04:21,970 --> 00:04:22,710
[The 16 media outlets
that first exposed the false information]

72
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:23,370
[have now been traced back
to Huanxun Zonglan Media.]

73
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:25,810
[Lin Di'er, Group Chairwoman]

74
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,910
Ms. Lin's name appears prominently

75
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,770
on the records.

76
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:35,800
Presumably,

77
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:38,800
Ms. Lin orchestrated all of this herself.

78
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,600
But I can't believe

79
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,000
a wife would want to

80
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,480
frame her own husband.

81
00:04:46,810 --> 00:04:49,490
Anyone could have forged these documents.

82
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:50,120
[Huanxun Zonglan Media]
[Lin Di'er, Group Chairwoman]

83
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,510
Xu Jing,

84
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,650
didn't you say it yourself?

85
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,920
He is my husband.

86
00:04:55,659 --> 00:04:56,790
Why would I harm him?

87
00:05:04,950 --> 00:05:07,080
Of course I know why you would harm him.

88
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,940
Do you think after doing this,

89
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,890
you'll still be the person he trusts most?

90
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,270
You bitch!

91
00:05:14,330 --> 00:05:16,910
[Huanxun Zonglan Media]

92
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,620
Ms. Lin Di'er,

93
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:19,240
based on a real-name report
from the public,

94
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,840
you are suspected
of illegal business operations.

95
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,660
Please come with us to the police station

96
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:25,520
for formal questioning
in accordance with the law.

97
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,830
You set me up!

98
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,480
I'm telling you!

99
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,280
Ms. Lin Di'er,

100
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:31,040
-You think you can beat me?
-Calm down!

101
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,430
Let go of me!

102
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,760
-Calm down!
-Calm down!

103
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,230
Just you wait.

104
00:05:40,290 --> 00:05:44,570
[Huanxun Zonglan Media]

105
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:24,380
Hello?

106
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,530
Your DNA test results with Qiao are in.

107
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,550
Qiao...

108
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,810
is your child.

109
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,580
Why?

110
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,920
Why?

111
00:07:22,970 --> 00:07:24,900
Why?

112
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:38,460
My child.

113
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:50,260
At least the child is still alive.

114
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,280
Once all of this is over,

115
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:55,080
you can be together.

116
00:07:55,110 --> 00:07:56,670
For the child's sake,

117
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,740
you must pull yourself together.

118
00:08:34,570 --> 00:08:35,520
Xiaoxiao.

119
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,159
Xiaoxiao.

120
00:08:45,370 --> 00:08:46,160
Xiaoxiao!

121
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,950
Xiaoxiao, where are you?

122
00:08:47,950 --> 00:08:48,770
Xiaoxiao!

123
00:09:00,110 --> 00:09:01,770
Give my child back to me!

124
00:09:03,170 --> 00:09:03,810
Xiaoxiao!

125
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,270
Xiaoxiao.

126
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,330
A'lan.

127
00:09:41,450 --> 00:09:42,170
A'lan.

128
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,150
I'm sorry.

129
00:09:46,930 --> 00:09:48,880
I lost Xiaoxiao.

130
00:09:52,530 --> 00:09:54,980
And I made you live like this.

131
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:56,320
I'm sorry.

132
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,200
Mom said

133
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:02,440
there was something in my eyes

134
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,730
that made her proud,

135
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,200
yet also worried her.

136
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,910
I never understood

137
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:11,150
what she meant by that.

138
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:13,320
But the first time I saw you,

139
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:16,670
I saw that same look in your eyes.

140
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:18,930
What look?

141
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:20,550
Determination.

142
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:23,910
When I was little learning to dance,

143
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,000
I was always the first to get back up
after falling.

144
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:29,000
Because I knew what I wanted.

145
00:10:30,670 --> 00:10:31,510
And so do you.

146
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:36,250
If you were me,

147
00:10:36,610 --> 00:10:38,140
you should stand back up.

148
00:10:52,470 --> 00:10:53,280
A'lan.

149
00:10:53,310 --> 00:10:54,440
I promise you.

150
00:10:55,090 --> 00:10:57,520
I will bring Xiaoxiao back to me.

151
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,080
I will make Zhao Xiao, Lin Di'er,

152
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,720
and those who hurt us

153
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,590
pay the price.

154
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:08,440
I don't know

155
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:11,870
why I became the way you are now,

156
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:14,960
but I want to tell you

157
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:18,630
that I have never regretted becoming you.
